<%#
  The hero ground: footage of a real counter, under the CSS brand layers.

  The MP4 that used to be here (/assets/logo/file.mp4) animated the RETIRED
  logo, so it contradicted the identity it was introducing — which is why it was
  taken out and the ground drawn in CSS instead. This is not that file. It is a
  silent, wordless, logo-free shot of a till being used, and the .vh-* layers it
  had before are still on top of it: the grid, the lime pool and the veil, so
  the type stays legible and the frame still reads as Vesopa rather than as
  stock footage.

  The still behind it is the same shot's stand-in, and it is what actually shows
  on a phone, on a metered connection and for anyone who has asked for less
  motion — see .vh-video in library/brand.css. Nobody on mobile data pays for
  four megabytes of background.
%>
<div class="container_1">
    <div class="vh-stage" aria-hidden="true">
        <video class="vh-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata">
            <source src="/assets/brand/hero_counter.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        <div class="vh-grid"></div>
        <div class="vh-glow"></div>
        <div class="vh-veil"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="vh-inner">
        <p class="vh-eyebrow">EPOS for hospitality &amp; retail</p>

        <h1 class="front_heading">One till. <span>Every part of the floor.</span></h1>
        <h2 class="front_heading_2">
            Vesopa EPOS runs the counter, the tables, the kitchen and the back office from one
            system — with <b>card payments, live reporting and offline trading</b> built in, not bolted on.
        </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="vh-actions">
        <a href="/trial" class="menu_get_button menu_get_button_middle">Start free trial</a>
        <a href="#features" class="vh-ghost">See the features</a>
    </div>

    <p class="money_back_text"><b>30 Day Money Back Guarantee</b></p>

    <div class="vh-proof">
        <div><b>Offline</b><span>Keeps trading</span></div>
        <div><b>Real&nbsp;time</b><span>Sales &amp; stock</span></div>
        <div><b>Card</b><span>Dojo · Teya · Barclaycard</span></div>
        <div><b>24/7</b><span>UK support</span></div>
    </div>
</div>

